# Frigate runs internal Python/s6/ffmpeg processes requiring root privileges at entrypoint and write access to /dev/shm and runtime dirs
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0012 (Runs as root user)
KSV-0012
AVD-KSV-0012

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0014 (Root file system is not read-only)
KSV-0014
AVD-KSV-0014

# Frigate config.yml contains environment variable template placeholders ({FRIGATE_...}) evaluated at runtime by container
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-01010 (ConfigMap with sensitive content)
KSV-01010
AVD-KSV-01010
